map.go`: Emitted workspace-relative dependent paths, exact `go.mod` module path resolution, and disambiguated Go importer directories in `ComputeWorkspaceImpact`.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/impact_map_deps.go`: Added `listPolyglotStemImporters` returning sorted workspace-relative 1-hop dependent paths.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/toolchain_runner.go`: Raised `maxToolchainErrOutput` to `1600` and anchored `findToolchainFailureOffset` on `# \u003cpkg\u003e` and compiler diagnostic lines ahead of `FAIL` summary lines.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/context_cache_test.go`: Added unit tests covering pipeline memoization, 1-hop dependent paths, exact `go.mod` reverse-importer resolution, compiler error truncation anchoring, and exact task log grep boundaries.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_task_sync.go`: Ordered `autoCommitDirtyWorktree` ahead of `executeGateCheckForTask` in `finalizeSync` so dirty worktrees commit once before final DoD gate verification.\n\n## Verification\n- Executed unit tests across `core/storage`, `modules/verify`, and `cli`.\n- Verified all 42 Definition of Done gates via `nomos verify` and `nomos task sync SUB-2180`.\n\n","sha256_receipt":"c6e4bb4808db83f5f964860a3b6c445818e26657195fdf0c5934fb64514823bc"}
